START

OPEN Wireshark

SELECT active network interface

START packet capturing

GENERATE RTP traffic
WAIT for 20 to 30 seconds

STOP packet capturing

APPLY RTP display filter

IF RTP packets are not identified THEN
    DECODE UDP packets as RTP
END IF

OPEN Telephony menu

SELECT RTP Streams

CHOOSE required RTP stream

CLICK Analyze

OBSERVE:
    Sequence Number
    Packet Delay
    Jitter
    Skew
    Packet Loss

RECORD the observations

STOP
